sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If two medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a rational rectangle are added together, the whole is irrational; let it be called the <i>first bimedial</i> straight line.
----
proof:

Let two medial straight lines {AB} and {BC} commensurable in square only and containing a rational rectangle be added together.

I say that the whole {AC} is irrational.

